    <h2>What the install covers</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>A load calculation to size the generator.</li>
        <li>A concrete or composite pad, set back from windows and vents as the code requires.</li>
        <li>An automatic transfer switch at your panel.</li>
        <li>Gas line connection by a licensed plumber we work with.</li>
        <li>Permits, inspection and start-up testing with you present.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Partial or whole home</h2>
    <p>A smaller generator can carry the essentials: furnace, fridge, sump pump, a few circuits of lights. A whole-home unit with load management runs almost everything. We will price both so you can choose.</p>
